  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "线程调度",
      "items": [
        "UseCase.execute 统一装配 subscribeOn(Schedulers.from(threadExecutor)) 与 observeOn(postExecutionThread.getScheduler())",
        "UIThread 用 AndroidSchedulers.mainThread() 实现 PostExecutionThread，presentation 只依赖接口"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "失败路径",
      "items": [
        "RestApiImpl 无网络或解析失败时发 NetworkConnectionException，Observer.onError 收到",
        "Presenter 把异常包成 DefaultErrorBundle，经 ErrorMessageFactory 转文案后 showError + showRetry"
      ]
    }
  ]
